1497,maize,Fusarium Ear Rot,Fungal,Severe,Fusarium verticillioides,Mold growth starts at leaf tip and spreads down,Control insect damage to ears which invites fungus,Rabi,Ear,Haryana
1498,sugarcane,Red Rot,Fungal,Low,Colletotrichum falcatum,Pith of infected stem turns completely red and withers,Treat setts with Carbendazim 50 WP at 1 gram per liter,Kharif,Stalk,Telangana
1499,sugarcane,Smut,Fungal,Low,Sporisorium scitamineum,Black whip like structure exists and bears powdery black spores,Treat setts with hot water at 52 degree for 30 minutes,Summer,Tillers,Telangana
1500,soyabean,Pod and Stem Blight,Fungal,Mild,Diaporthe phaseolorum,Seeds inside infected pods are shrivelled and stained,Improve field drainage to reduce moisture on plant surface,Post-Monsoon,Stem,Telangana
